OL,3,AIsrael-bound flight diverted after
OL,4,Afight between pilots
OL,5,
OL,6,FA flight from Dubai to Tel Aviv was
OL,7,Funexpectedly diverted after a physical
OL,8,Ffight between the pilots, Israeli
OL,9,Fofficials told local media.
OL,11,FThe Flydubai plane - which took off
OL,12,Ffrom Dubai International Airport in the
OL,13,FUnited Arab Emirates early on Wednesday
OL,14,Fmorning - signalled an emergency code
OL,15,Ftwo hours into the journey, flight
OL,16,Ftracking website Flightradar24 said.
OL,18,FMinutes later it switched to a code
OL,19,Fused to report a hijacking, but was
OL,20,Flater turned back to the general
OL,21,Femergency signal, the website reported.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
